# Data quality log

## Issue 1: Two sheets overlap, plus repeated rows
- The two sheets overlap from 2010-12-01 to 2010-12-09 (sheet 1 ends
  2010-12-09 20:01, sheet 2 starts 2010-12-01 08:26).
- Both sheets have 22,523 rows in that window, and 100% of the invoices in
  sheet 1's window also appear in sheet 2's window.
- After stacking, 34,335 rows were exact duplicates: 22,523 from the
  overlap, and about 11,812 repeated rows inside a single sheet (6,865 in
  sheet 1 and 5,268 in sheet 2).
- Action: removed all with drop_duplicates(). 1,067,371 -> 1,033,036 rows.
- Assumption: repeats inside a sheet are entry errors. Some may be real
  repeated purchases.

